    <li><strong>Custom Playwright/Puppeteer Scripts:</strong> Flexible, but requires maintaining local browser clusters, managing proxy rotations, and handling CAPTCHA solvers yourself.</li>
    <li><strong>Ollagraph MCP Integration (Recommended):</strong> Fully managed cloud infrastructure, every Ollagraph endpoint as a tool, stealth browser rendering, refunds on failed calls, and 2-minute setup.</li>
  </ul>

